chezmoi dots secrets — Run a declared secret-manager CLI with its token

USAGE
  chezmoi dots secrets <command> [options]

COMMANDS
  run        Run a declared CLI with its access token injected

ARGUMENTS
  command  run; the command is the first argument after secrets.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots secrets run example-vault -- project list
